{
  "source": "/private/tmp/document-trap-live-opening.wav",
  "duration": 78.0,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.12,
      "text": "Picture this, your basketball team just made it to the season-end tournament."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.7,
      "end": 7.38,
      "text": "The games start next week, and the stakes are high."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.88,
      "end": 12.68,
      "text": "But before you step on the court, you need to read the league's massive 200-page rulebook."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.22,
      "end": 14.68,
      "text": "Nobody has time to read all that."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.04,
      "end": 20.14,
      "text": "So you drop the entire PDF into your favorite AI chatbot and ask a critical question."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.76,
      "end": 22.86,
      "text": "How many fouls until a player fouls out?"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.36,
      "end": 28.02,
      "text": "The system pauses for a second, then spits out a confident, perfectly plausible answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.46,
      "end": 29.24,
      "text": "Five fouls."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.24,
      "end": 30.16,
      "text": "But wait."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.6,
      "end": 34.38,
      "text": "You remember a game last year where a player stayed on the court after their fifth foul?"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.88,
      "end": 37.66,
      "text": "You open the actual PDF and start searching manually."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.34,
      "end": 39.64,
      "text": "Sure enough, there's a catch."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.16,
      "end": 42.4,
      "text": "The regular season limit is five fouls."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.46,
      "end": 45.12,
      "text": "But buried in a special section near the end of the book,"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.42,
      "end": 48.9,
      "text": "it clearly states that for tournament play, the limit increases to six."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.54,
      "end": 53.24,
      "text": "The AI pulled the standard limit while completely ignoring the tournament exception."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.8,
      "end": 57.54,
      "text": "You're left with a half-truth that feels like a complete answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.09,
      "end": 59.74,
      "text": "This is the document trap."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.2,
      "end": 65.24,
      "text": "The mistaken belief that uploading a file is the same thing as the system reading it."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.82,
      "end": 68.34,
      "text": "To understand why it missed that crucial detail,"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.72,
      "end": 71.0,
      "text": "we need to look at how AI memory works."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.64,
      "end": 73.68,
      "text": "Every model has a context window."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.32,
      "end": 77.98,
      "text": "Think of this as the maximum amount of text it can actively juggle."
    }
  ],
